  "limitations": [
    "No chordae tendineae, moderator band, pectinate muscles, fossa ovalis, crista terminalis or conduction meshes verified in this source.",
    "This is a static adult single-specimen atlas; no embryological animation, valve motion, perfusion, or dominance variants.",
    "Source valve cusp orientation terminology retained; do not relabel coronary/noncoronary cusps without visual validation.",
    "LV papillary mesh grouping retained; not relabeled separate clinical groups.",
    "Existing coronary IDs now own only mesh elements not allocated to named branch IDs.",
    "RV and LV IDs are cavity surfaces, not myocardium."
